There are other ways. I did the end game as a pacifist with out pets
and my spell points in the low 20's (so i couldn't depend on charm
monster.) I had no problems with any of the riders. I am not saying
that you should do the end game this way but i did learn lessons that
will help a wombat. The lesson learned is to use conflict and summon
monsters to surround you. You have many options for this. You can use
the read the cursed book of the dead or cursed scrolls of genocide to
summon hard hitting monsters. They will wail on the rider enough so
that if he does step next to you then he will go down in one strike.
Most of the time, though, the critters take him down. Then you
teleport the mass out of the way(make sure you know where the rider
went down so as not to teleport his %.) and run past the critters. If
you really feel scared you summon more monsters behind you and leave
them alive so that when the rider revives he can't get to you as
quickly.  




> It is true that being killed by Pestilence is s.th. that cannot be
