No, you can avoid being killed by him with any class. There are so
many ways to make the riders a joke provided you don't mess around
and go straight through to the altars. Just don't kill everything,
just what is in your way and that will keep the riders from having
free room to race towards you. /of teleport do this well, since the
critters get sent elsewhere and then may impede the other riders with
their existence, even without conflict. 

